  "name": {
   "zh": "摄影机解算 · COLMAP",
   "en": "Camera Solve · COLMAP"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "COLMAP 官方自述是通用的运动恢复结构（SfM）与多视图立体（MVS）流程，成组画面无论有序无序都能算。这张卡用它解算每帧摄影机，交付带一层稀疏点云的摄影机 USD 和 Nuke 摄影机。勾「显卡提取特征」（SiftGPU）时整张卡按非商用算。镜头模型选带畸变的时，同时交付去畸变 EXR（画面与两张 ST 贴图）。",
   "en": "COLMAP describes itself as a general-purpose Structure-from-Motion (SfM) and Multi-View Stereo (MVS) pipeline that works on ordered or unordered image sets. This card solves a camera per frame and delivers a camera USD with a layer of sparse point cloud, plus a Nuke camera. With GPU Feature Extraction (SiftGPU) on, the whole card counts as non-commercial. When a lens model with distortion is chosen, it also delivers an undistorted EXR (the image and two ST maps)."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-09-11T11:00:00",
  "deliverable": "camera_traj",
  "owner": "admin",
  "updated": "2026-10-03T01:00:00"
 },
